<title>POLAND: Relpol to pay no 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Relpol to pay no 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish electromagnetic transmitter producer Relpol SA plans to put virtually all of its 5.3-million-zloty 1996 net profit into reserves, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Relpol said shareholders would vote on the proposal on May 24.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
